# scripts/rebrand.py config (Vulnesis/ops).
# belai is shared by both brands: only documents are rebranded. The code keeps
# Vulnetix defaults and VULNETIX_BRAND=vulnesis selects vulnes.is at run time.
docs-only
keep VULNETIX_
# Embedded skills and prompts (Markdown under internal/) ship in the binary and
# are followed by agents at run time: they stay as in Vulnetix.
ignore internal/*
# A transferred Pages site keeps its one custom domain (vulnes.is via a proxy).
keep belai.vulnetix.com
# The tool the model is offered is named Vulnetix (code formatting in the docs is
# its identifier; tools_docs_test checks every tool is documented by name).
keep `Vulnetix`
keep `Vulnetix(
